      "belief": "把操作語當文章資訊。",
      "whyWrong": "會答錯內容。",
      "correction": "圈 task verb。"
    },
    {
      "belief": "忽略數量。",
      "whyWrong": "產出不合。",
      "correction": "先標 one/two/all。"
    },
